  "solution": "Logic : (1st number + 2nd number) × 5 = 3rd number\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• (5, 11, 80)\n\n**(5 + 11)**__ × 5 = 80\n\n__**16 × 5**__ = 80 \n\n80 = 80 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (6, 12, 90)\n\n(6 + 12)__ × 5 = 90\n\n__18 × 5__ = 90 \n\n90 = 90 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 4, 19, 148\n\n(4 + 19)__ × 5 = 148\n\n__23 × 5__ = 148\n\n115 ≠ 148 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 9, 11, 67 \n\n(9 + 11)__ × 5 = 67\n\n__20 × 5__ = 67 \n\n100 ≠ 67 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 7, 17, 120\n\n(7 + 17)__ × 5 = 120\n\n__24 × 5__ = 120 \n\n120 = 120 (LHS = RHS) \n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 2, 16, 123\n\n(2 + 16)__ × 5 = 123\n\n__18 × 5__ = 123\n\n90 ≠ 123 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
